    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798590/extras/653ace0c41325255415eec6b497d7c83.avif?t=1751266812\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pat Pat Cat is a clicker game where you take care of your feline friend. Pat your cat to watch the love pile up! Customize your cat\u2019s appearance and the background using a variety of accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798590/extras/7726b184d92efccb28739a7e53b8506e.poster.avif?t=1751266812\" width=650 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798590/extras/7726b184d92efccb28739a7e53b8506e.webm?t=1751266812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798590/extras/7726b184d92efccb28739a7e53b8506e.mp4?t=1751266812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pat and name your cat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock accessories to customize your cat and scenery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save and swap templates of your customizations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and upgrade items\u2014your cat will give back by producing even more love</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic progress saving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pat your cat\u2014it\u2019s very important!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798590/extras/9f7a9b97bc4867780655fb72aa7293f2.poster.webp?t=1751266812\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798590/extras/9f7a9b97bc4867780655fb72aa7293f2.webp?t=1751266812\" class=\"bb_img\" width=650 height=234 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just sit back, relax, and enjoy caring for your little kitty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798590/extras/a5d4752f16eee42b6d9bf5c0e4a22de7.avif?t=1751266812\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798590/extras/653ace0c41325255415eec6b497d7c83.avif?t=1751266812\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pat Pat Cat is a clicker game where you take care of your feline friend. Pat your cat to watch the love pile up! Customize your cat\u2019s appearance and the background using a variety of accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798590/extras/7726b184d92efccb28739a7e53b8506e.poster.avif?t=1751266812\" width=650 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798590/extras/7726b184d92efccb28739a7e53b8506e.webm?t=1751266812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798590/extras/7726b184d92efccb28739a7e53b8506e.mp4?t=1751266812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pat and name your cat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock accessories to customize your cat and scenery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save and swap templates of your customizations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and upgrade items\u2014your cat will give back by producing even more love</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic progress saving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pat your cat\u2014it\u2019s very important!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798590/extras/9f7a9b97bc4867780655fb72aa7293f2.poster.webp?t=1751266812\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798590/extras/9f7a9b97bc4867780655fb72aa7293f2.webp?t=1751266812\" class=\"bb_img\" width=650 height=234 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just sit back, relax, and enjoy caring for your little kitty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798590/extras/a5d4752f16eee42b6d9bf5c0e4a22de7.avif?t=1751266812\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p>",
